title: Commvault CommServe
agents: commvault_rest
catalog: app/other
license: GPLv2
distribution:
description:
 Shows the result of the Commvault REST special agent run: login, CommServe
 host name and version, and errors of single API query groups (jobs, storage,
 VMs). A failed login is CRIT, a failed query group WARN; the services of that
 group become UNKNOWN. Also WARN if the job list was truncated by the page
 limit. The agent run time is recorded as a metric.

 The service details show how many jobs were fetched, how many SQL
 transaction log jobs were found and which jobs were skipped (VM child jobs,
 restores, jobs without subclient, optionally Distributed Data Platforms).

discovery:
 One service on the host running the Commvault REST special agent.
